sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthorService
    participant AuthorRepository
    participant Database
    participant ListAuthor

    Client->>+AuthorService: findAll()
    Note right of Client: Client calls AuthorService.findAll

    AuthorService->>+AuthorRepository: findAll()
    Note right of AuthorService: AuthorService delegates to repository.findAll

    AuthorRepository->>+Database: SELECT * FROM authors
    Note right of AuthorRepository: Repository queries database

    Database->>+ListAuthor: return result set
    Note right of Database: List of Author records from database

    ListAuthor-->>-AuthorRepository: result set
    AuthorRepository-->>-AuthorService: return ListAuthor
    Note right of AuthorRepository: List of Author objects

    AuthorService-->>-Client: return ListAuthor
    Note right of AuthorService: List of Author objects returned to client
